    "body": "DESIGN ONLY. No implementation, merge, canon change, archive rewrite, service, daemon, or memory-system mutation.\n\nPurpose: prolong ZORR working-chat life while preserving decision fidelity through delta-only communication, compact unsuperseded current state, existing durable archive authority, and minimum evidence-complete JIT restore.\n\nBase main: b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1\nTracker: #235\n\nKey acceptance: behavioral decision parity, stale/superseded rejection, contradiction fail-closed, OWNER-lock retention, verified lesson transfer, cold-start handoff, and measured context reduction without truth loss.\n\nThis PR is for OWNER design review only. Implementation requires separate approved plan.",
